window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Love is the sweetest venom. </p> <p>Lawrence: I told her I wanted her body and not her love. I lied. </p> <p>Ronan: I fell in love with a lie.... She was beauty and destruction. </p> <p>Kissing her was a tender song. Owning her body, a wild poem. Loving her, my downfall. But she was mine. Or so I thought. </p> <p>Blaire: One man offered me his love. The other, the world. </p> <p>I'm falling, falling, falling.... And there's no end in sight. </p>"; 
